<title>USA: BayBank wins Lynn, Mass., water and sewer BANs.</title>
<headline>BayBank wins Lynn, Mass., water and sewer BANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BayBank said it won $23 million of Lynn, Mass., water and sewer bond anticipation notes.</p>
<p>The net interest cost was 4.0505 percent and the coupon was 4.50 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
